ous plans for the future.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"I'm thrilled to join Deportivo AELU and be a part of this exciting project,\\\" Pierre said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"\\\"The team's passion and dedication to the sport align perfectly with my own values, and I'm looking forward to contributing to the club's success.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Pierre's impressive stats, including 15 goals and 20 assists in 50 appearances for his previous club, made him a hot commodity on the transfer market.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Deportivo AELU's manager, Juan Carlos García, praised Pierre's signing, saying, \\\"Frédéric is a world-class player who will undoubtedly elevate our team's performance.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"His creativity and work rate will be a valuable asset to our squad.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"The Belgian midfielder is expected to make his debut for Deportivo AELU in the upcoming match against CD Leganés on March 20.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Fans are eagerly anticipating his arrival, with ticket sales for the match already surpassing 20,000.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Data from the Spanish Football Federation shows that Deportivo AELU has seen a significant increase in attendance and revenue since the start of the season, with the club's average attendance rising by 15% and revenue increasing by 20%.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"The signing of Pierre is expected to further boost the club's popularity and financial performance.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"When asked about his expectations for the season, Pierre said, \\\"I'm focused on helping the team achieve its goals and making a strong push for a top-five finish in the league.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"With the talent and dedication of my new teammates, I'm confident we can make it happen.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"As Pierre settles into his new role, fans a